Design Pattern References

This repository contains original summaries and Claude Code plugin guidance for established software architecture patterns.

Pattern catalogs are attributed as follows:

- Gang of Four design patterns: Erich Gamma, Richard Helm, Ralph Johnson, and John Vlissides, Design Patterns: Elements of Reusable Object-Oriented Software.
- Enterprise Integration Patterns: Gregor Hohpe and Bobby Woolf, Enterprise Integration Patterns. Public pattern index: https://www.enterpriseintegrationpatterns.com/patterns/messaging/toc.html

Pattern names and categories are used for reference and interoperability. Explanatory text in this repository is original.

